{"product_id":"geekvape-frenzy-pod-system","title":"GeekVape Frenzy Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Geek Vape FRENZY Pod System is an exquisitely crafted all-in-one vape kit, encapsulating all the of finest qualities such as advanced AS chipset with Power Output \/ Temperature Control Mode, 950mAh internal battery, and utilize the NS Mesh Coil Technology. Built with a zinc-alloy chassis with resin panels, the FRENZY Pod System adopts a strong and durable chassis to protect the advanced AS Chipset along with top-of-the line ergonomic handling. The chipset can provide an ultra-fast responsive firing time, alongside Intelligent Output Mode with automatic detection for Temperature Control Mode and adjustable Voltage Output Mode. The FRENZY Replacement Pod Cartridge holds up to 2mL of eLiquid, implementing a bottom-fill method with one of the most dynamic airflow design for a pod system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003eGeek Vape NS Coils\u003cbr\u003eGeek Vape FRENZY Replacement Pods\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGeek Vape FRENZY Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAS Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 86.1mm by 37mm by 15.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 950mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Mode: 2.5V \/ 2.7V \/ 2.9V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Control Mode: 420F \/ 440F \/ 460F\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.7-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAutomatic Output Matching Function\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOWER Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBOOST Mode - Temperature Control Only\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Control Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Dependent Firing Modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Charging Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottom Ventilation Holes\u003c\/li\u003e\n